 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yXVr__3LGZcQ7kNvwHqKvMD&_nc_oc=Adrank_YwdZngTo3KSDUM6Crv-ZEER6cKbAPkzPdz9yenIXervCQQyMctYEixrtSCKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFBMxCmrTFXn6_BLP3bJ9ElcYghmPBEcVvrXMeFQ16EOg&oe=6A843F81"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0jagG1L0O-EQ7kNvwGQfY3K&_nc_oc=Adq79icZwl_Cgu3H84Yzcc9QNyS02IT87x4Zm1Z0F8BBFuE7sh78YjyYGync1Qu6PQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGkdGt9PZ-60sav87_aYJTe3OFutj50buC0ML_gjRqOGw&oe=6A844CE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z-drlBrGN4QQ7kNvwE6BcHh&_nc_oc=AdrKqaEZXgpGflmI6P-IHL4k2WxJp1uu6dgnqvo5ABQvgt9_twnGtXTJ-mXKkDgNlcc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGR-JHE6TlwlgF9uzS1uQNvM2yRxrxskhmqelXc39ZWOA&oe=6A8456DC"}, {"fil